  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'9\" bed of 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet Silverado 1500 and GMC Sierra 1500 (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate). Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2019 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 New Body Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\n2020-2026 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit: Reliable manufacture brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'9\" bed of 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevy Silverado 1500 and GMC Sierra 1500 new body style (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate and Carbonpro Bed).\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the bed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\nGreat Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with solid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your truck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
